==Problem description==
No power after NVME Replacement
[[File:Placeholder image.jpg|thumb|Example image (Figure 1) -- No image yet. Help expand this page by uploading it!]]
==Symptoms==

*No Power
*Not Charging

==Solution==

* Charge IC (MAX77961) is blown and will need to be replaced
* Info: https://www.maximintegrated.com/en/products/power/battery-management/MAX77961.html